    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Last Table</strong> is a psychological horror experience where your ordinary shift takes a deadly turn. As a waitress in a small restaurant, you must manage your duties while under the watchful gaze of a sinister stalker. Each order you serve brings you closer to a final, terrifying confrontation. Use your wits, stay one step ahead, and survive the night\u2014or become his next victim. Will you make it through the shift, or is this your last table?</p>",
